      "targeted_symptom": "S005",
      "patient_response": "Hello, Dr. Smith. It is so very nice to meet you, too. Thank you for taking the time to see me. \n\nUm, well, I hope I'm not wasting your time, but... I suppose I came in because I just can't seem to get anything in order lately. It's a bit embarrassing to admit, really, because I've always tried my best to keep a nice home for my family. But... well, my kitchen table is just covered right now. It's gotten a bit cluttered with my husband's appointment papers, and some church flyers, and notes from the senior center... oh, and all these half-finished to-do lists I make. \n\nI sit down there meaning to sort it all out, and I just... I don't know which thing to do first. I just sort of stare at it, and then, before I know it, the whole day is just gone. I'm sure it sounds silly, and I really do try to stay on top of things, but... is that the sort of thing you help people with?",
